    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "557058:e25d94d0-bd50-4c2c-906c-14cdf85801fb",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f53ee0691ccb59ede3ec232c18af4e16?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-5.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f53ee0691ccb59ede3ec232c18af4e16?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-5.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f53ee0691ccb59ede3ec232c18af4e16?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-5.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f53ee0691ccb59ede3ec232c18af4e16?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-5.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Chris Wilper",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3Ae25d94d0-bd50-4c2c-906c-14cdf85801fb",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Not sure if this is relevant yet, but on Feb 8th, Herbert Van de Sompel wrote to public-lod at w3.org:",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "A while ago, there was an interesting discussion on this list regarding the Memento proposal. The discussion is probably best summarized by referencing Pete Johnston's blog entry:",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "http://efoundations.typepad.com/efoundations/2009/11/memento-and-negotiating-on-time.html"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "http://efoundations.typepad.com/efoundations/2009/11/memento-and-negotiating-on-time.html",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Following feedback from that discussion, and invaluable input received at a recent meeting with representatives from major web archives (see ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "http://www.mementoweb.org/events/IA201002/),"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "http://www.mementoweb.org/events/IA201002/),",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " we have made some revisions/rationalizations to the proposed framework. ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "The updated perspective is summarized in the slide deck at:",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "http://www.slideshare.net/hvdsomp/memento-updated-technical-details-february-2010"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "http://www.slideshare.net/hvdsomp/memento-updated-technical-details-february-2010",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "The major changes are:",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "attrs": {
           "id": "atlassian-yellow_star",
           "shortName": ":yellow_star:",
           "text": ":yellow_star:"
          },
          "type": "emoji"
         },
         {
          "text": " Use of a HTTP Link header instead of a HTTP 302 redirect to allow navigation from an Original Resource to a TimeGate for it. This solves a caching issue faced by the initial approach, and also allows applying the framework to non-information resources in order to allow retrieving their prior descriptions (see the final slides of the aforementioned slide deck).",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "attrs": {
           "id": "atlassian-yellow_star",
           "shortName": ":yellow_star:",
           "text": ":yellow_star:"
          },
          "type": "emoji"
         },
         {
          "text": " Use of the same architecture (distinct Original Resource, TimeGate, Memento) for scenarios that involve Web archives and Content Management Systems as servers of Mementos.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
